### SmartHire candidate-service samples (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client).

@cands = http://localhost:8082/api/v1

### Health
GET http://localhost:8082/readyz

### 1. Register a candidate
# @name register
POST {{cands}}/candidates
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: candidate-self

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "full_name": "Ada Lovelace",
  "phone": "+923001234567",
  "location": "Lahore",
  "headline": "Backend Engineer, Go & Postgres",
  "summary": "5 years building distributed systems.",
  "years_experience": 5,
  "skills": [
    { "name": "Go", "level": "advanced", "years": 4 },
    { "name": "PostgreSQL", "level": "intermediate", "years": 3 }
  ]
}

@candId = {{register.response.body.id}}

### 2. Same email (any case) -> 409
POST {{cands}}/candidates
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ADA@example.com", "full_name": "Someone Else" }

### 3. Work experience (end_date null = current job)
PUT {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}/experiences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "experiences": [
    { "company": "Acme", "title": "Senior Go Developer", "start_date": "2022-03-01", "end_date": null },
    { "company": "Initech", "title": "Backend Developer", "start_date": "2019-07-01", "end_date": "2022-02-28" }
  ]
}

### 4. Education
PUT {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}/educations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "educations": [
    { "institution": "NUST", "degree": "BS", "field_of_study": "Computer Science", "start_year": 2015, "end_year": 2019 }
  ]
}

### 5. Replace skills
PUT {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}/skills
Content-Type: application/json

{ "skills": [ { "name": "Go", "level": "expert", "years": 5 }, { "name": "Kafka" } ] }

### 6. Partial update (version from latest GET)
GET {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}

###
PATCH {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 4, "headline": "Senior Backend Engineer" }

### 7. Upload resume (PDF or DOCX, max 5 MiB). Put a real cv.pdf next to this file.
POST {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}/resume
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./cv.pdf
--boundary--

### 8. Download latest resume
GET {{cands}}/candidates/{{candId}}/resume

### 9. Recruiter search: by skill, location, free text
GET {{cands}}/candidates?skill=go&location=lahore&q=backend&limit=20
